  <data key="d0">sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2</data>
  <data key="d1">model</data>
  <data key="d2">一种推荐的BERT模型权重，用于提升LanguageModelFeaturizer的性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e2a73219a6b81a765a98ce10205dfeb7</data>
  <data key="d4">操作步骤1.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1767073851</data>
